1
00:00:03,550 --> 00:00:10,420
A boy is walking on street.

2
00:00:10,420 --> 00:00:16,260
An old beggar steps in front of boy.

3
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:25,020
Old man's figure hunchbacked, clothes torn ragged.

4
00:00:25,640 --> 00:00:36,220
Old man holds out swollen dirty hand begging for help.

5
00:00:37,080 --> 00:00:48,710
Boy searches pockets but finds nothing to give old man.

6
00:00:50,040 --> 00:00:54,510
Boy tightly holds old man's hand:

7
00:00:54,510 --> 00:01:05,820
Grandpa don't be angry, I have nothing to give you.

8
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:17,020
Beggar looks at boy, pale lips smile.

9
00:01:17,020 --> 00:01:22,080
Old man pats boy's hand, says:

10
00:01:22,080 --> 00:01:35,730
Thank you child! Your sympathy is enough for me.

